rs":34109,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/python-poetry/poetry/pulls/10067","html_url":"https://github.com/python-poetry/poetry/pull/10067","diff_url":"https://github.com/python-poetry/poetry/pull/10067.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/python-poetry/poetry/pull/10067.patch","merged_at":"2025-01-23T18:43:08Z"},"body":"This change fixes an issue introduced in #10021 that led to options provided in the form `-<shortcut><value>` to be incorrectly handled.\r\n\r\nFurther, it also simplifies and fixes run command processing.\r\n\r\nResolves: #10051\r\n\r\n### Using pipx\r\n```sh\r\npipx install --suffix=@10067 'poetry @ git+https://github.com/python-poetry/poetry.git@refs/pull/10067/head'\r\nalias poetry=poetry@10067\r\npoetry new foobar\r\n# run poetry in verbose mode and output hi\r\npoetry -C ./foobar run -v echo hi\r\n# shows echo help\r\npoetry -C ./foobar run echo --help\r\n# shows poetry help\r\npoetry -P ./foobar --help run echo --help\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Using a container (podman | docker)\r\n```sh\r\npodman run --rm -i --entrypoint bash python:latest <<EOF\r\nset -xe\r\npython -m pip install --disable-pip-version-check -q git+https://github.com/python-poetry/poetry.git@refs/pull/10067/head\r\npoetry new foobar\r\npoetry -C /foobar run -v echo hi\r\npoetry -C /foobar run echo --help\r\npoetry -P /foobar --help run echo --help\r\nEOF\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Summary by Sourcery\r\n\r\nBug Fixes:\r\n- Fix incorrect parsing of global options when combined with the \"run\" command.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/python-poetry/poetry/issues/10067/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/python-poetry/poetry/issues/10067/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":